@startuml
autonumber
skinparam boxPadding 10
skinparam participantPadding 10

actor "User (CLI)" as User
participant "hermes-cli" as CLI
box "Server Zone" #LightBlue
participant "document-service" as DocServ
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Kafka" as Broker
end box

User -> CLI : hermes doc edit <doc_id>
activate CLI

CLI -> DocServ : gRPC: GetDocument(doc_id)
activate DocServ
DocServ -> DB : SELECT * FROM docs WHERE id=doc_id
DB --> DocServ : Return Doc (Text, Version=5)
DocServ --> CLI : Response (Text, Version=5)
deactivate DocServ

CLI -> CLI : OpenInSystemEditor(Text)
note over CLI: User edit text at\n Vim/Nano and save file

User -> CLI : :wq (Save and exit)

CLI -> DocServ : gRPC: UpdateDocument(doc_id, NewText, Version=5)
activate DocServ

DocServ -> DB : UPDATE docs SET text=NewText, version=version+1\nWHERE id=doc_id AND version=5
note over DB: Version check (Optimistic Lock)

alt Successfull change (Version same)
    DB --> DocServ : Rows Affected = 1
    DocServ -> DB : Insert Into Transactional Outbox (Event: DOC_UPDATED)
    DocServ --> CLI : gRPC: Success (New Version=6)
    CLI -> User : Print "Document updated successfully!"
else COnflict of edit (Version changed by somebody else)
    DB --> DocServ : Rows Affected = 0
    DocServ --> CLI : gRPC: Error (StatusAborted / Conflict)
    CLI -> User : Print "Conflict! Document was changed by another user."
end
deactivate DocServ
deactivate CLI
@enduml
